  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1344774/description_be132657-5c67-4e47-972a-5307c09d83fb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"241\" height=\"48\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/embeddium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1344774/description_868db16e-2d0e-41cc-a1ba-6e9f7ef12185.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"241\" height=\"48\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fimproved-sodiumembeddium-rus-translation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1344774/description_52418866-77d4-4ac9-9046-a4a39a739ae8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"236\" height=\"47\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">EN</span> 为 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">S</span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">odium<span style=\"color:#fff\"> | </span><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Embeddium</span></span> 提供优化的翻译，并包含部分附加模组：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamiclights-reforged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>动态光源</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chloride\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Chloride（Sodium/Embeddium++）</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xenon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Xenon（Embeddium 分支版）</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1344774/description_e4e591f3-64cd-4263-9a55-8821843f862d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"327\" height=\"69\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1344774/description_643fcbe8-ecf9-4b69-8d23-a9b98ded3452.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"327\" height=\"69\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">RU</span> 进一步优化 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">S</span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">odium<span style=\"color:#fff\"> | </span><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Embeddium</span></span> 及部分附加内容的本地化：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamiclights-reforged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>动态光源</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chloride\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Chloride（Sodium/Embeddium++）</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xenon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Xenon（Embeddium 分支版）</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;1.17.1-26.1</strong></p>",
